data: {"id": "9c884504408746d1-final", "run_id": "9c884504408746d1", "seq": 736, "ts_ms": 1788436192045, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state on node2 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning NoNetworkFound 48m multus: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 直接证明 Multus CNI 在尝试挂载网络时，在目标命名空间下找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件定义，导致持续报错。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container: app`, `reason: ContainerCreating` | 确认容器处于等待状态，由于网络插件阻塞无法完成初始化，印证了事件中的报错现象。 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 提供客观指标确认该 Pod 当前确实处于因网络问题导致的等待状态。 |\n\n多源事实高度一致：K8s 状态显示等待、指标确认等待状态、48 分钟内持续爆发的 `NoNetworkFound` 事件明确了阻塞的具体原因是“找不到网络定义”。由于容器未启动，日志与 Trace 数据不可用（物理限制），当前证据已完全覆盖故障现象的成因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n命名空间 aiops-case-05 中缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件在 Pod 启动阶段解析网络引用失败 → 网络附件挂载阻塞导致容器无法启动 → Pod 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Pod 配置引用的网络附件定义 `unavailable-network` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在。\n证据表明，Multus CNI 插件在初始化网络时无法找到该定义（见证据 #1 中的 `NoNetworkFound` 错误），从而直接阻断了容器的启动流程，导致 Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 #2, #3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 42.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 42.7s (Evidence 35.2s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 68.582, "metrics": {"run_id": "9c884504408746d1", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 68.58931732177734, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.25, "weighted_score": 0.05}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 68589.31732177734, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 54647.74823188782, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 30941.848039627075, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 13397.75538444519}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18370.63717842102, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 42707.02767372131, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_